      "name": "dsh-npu",
      "title": {
        "en": "Hearthcore · Local NPU/GPU",
        "zh": "燧心 · 本地推理"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Run local LLMs on AMD NPU (FastFlowLM) and GPU (llama.cpp Vulkan) on demand: one OpenAI-compatible port, ignition on first token, idle sleep, zero orphan processes, and the amd-hybrid fifth framework that drives NPU and GPU as two fires under one request.",
        "zh": "在本机 AMD NPU（FastFlowLM）与 GPU（llama.cpp Vulkan）上按需点火运行本地模型：对外只有一个 OpenAI 兼容端口，首问点火、空闲即熄、DSH 退出进程树清零；第五框架 amd-hybrid 让 NPU 与 GPU 双引擎协同服务同一个请求。"
      },
